OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers gather for Bonfire
OL,4,Abriefing before biggest police
OL,5,Aoperation of year
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice officers from around the country
OL,8,Fhave gathered in Edinburgh for a
OL,9,FBonfire Night briefing ahead of the
OL,10,F"biggest police operation" of the year.
OL,12,FSome of them will be embedded in fire
OL,13,Fstations and will travel with crews to
OL,14,Ftackle potential attacks on
OL,15,Ffirefighters during Bonfire Night.
OL,17,FAs many as 1,700 officers could be
OL,18,Fdeployed to deal with fireworks-related
OL,19,Fdisorder, a European football match
OL,20,Finvolving Celtic and potential protests
OL,21,Fin Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
